WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.510
Can I eat it, Liu Bei?

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.960
Can I?

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.230
Not yet!

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.230
Just wait a little longer!

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.230
<b>Nariyuki-kun</b>

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.480
Come on, sit down!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.570
Not yet.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.300
Thanks, Liu Bei-chan.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.740
You're a huge help.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.030
I'm a maid, it's nothing.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.750
You should celebrate, too.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.550
Everyone would be delighted.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.290
Thanks, but...

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.850
Liu Bei...

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.550
You celebrate, too!

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:40.480
Okay, just for a little.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.090
I'm sorry.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.150
I'm sorry!

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.150
The sun...

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.990
is setting!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.190
<b>"Girl 
Hawk" 
Maid 
Dispatch 
Agency</b>

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.740
<b>Curses of the World</b>

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.500
I thought so, it doesn't have anything.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:08.220
What do I have to do to end this curse,

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.130
where I turn into a pig at sunset?

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.750
Liu Bei-chan?

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.720
Be right there.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.020
Morning, Liu Bei-chan.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.760
This is your next job.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.590
Right.

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:23.140
About that...

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.520
She's a maid crusher.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.600
Maid crusher?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.320
She used to be an actress.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:35.010
All the maids I sent quit.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.610
As long as she's hired us,
 I can't refuse.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.400
So I'd like you to give it a try.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:46.240
If we've been hired, 
she needs help, right?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.120
Yup.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.190
All right.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.410
Leave it to me.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.150
They should've been called...

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:21.620
Excuse me!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.280
Stop that.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:35.790
Stop it!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.220
I'm from the maid agency.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.590
A maid?

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.800
With that silly outfit?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:46.050
This is my resume and 
letter of introduction.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:51.060
Liu Bei

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.120
Liu Bei?

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:51.060
Maiden Empress of Shu?

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.330
Yes.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.560
Nice to meet you.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.940
What movie is that from?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.980
Liar!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.690
I'm not lying.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.680
I was working in the warring states world,

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.710
for the people who need me!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.340
What a bunch of nonsense.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.640
Do it over!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.190
Understood.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.790
What would you like for me to redo?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.290
All of it.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.780
I don't need a maid, anyway.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.050
Get lost.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.130
I'll be back tomorrow. 
-Liu Bei

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.670
Yes? This is Liu Bei.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.490
Boss, good morning.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.900
Liu Bei-chan, I didn't 
hear anything yesterday.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:58.980
Were you okay?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.930
Yeah. Fine.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.460
They did need help.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:06.350
I'll be going again today.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.000
Okay!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.790
What are you doing?

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.850
Tae-san, good morning.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.830
Your yard's all pretty now,

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.470
so I thought you might 
enjoy tea on the terrace.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:36.180
I made a table and chairs.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.540
Now your yard is perfect.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:42.940
Come in.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:45.310
Okay!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:50.300
Use what's here to clean or something.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.990
All right. Leave it to me.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:59.240
My room and the kitchen 
are off limits, okay?

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.380
The kitchen?

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.630
What about lunch?

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.290
I can make it myself.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.610
Look at this...

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.260
Just a bit more, maybe...

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:31.010
And then...

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:43.690
I'll be back tomorrow.

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:56.390
Thank you!

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:58.410
Welcome!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:08:59.890
Thank you!

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.640
We've got sweet strawberries!

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:09.330
Tae-san might like strawberries.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.110
You can do it, Liu Bei-chan!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.750
Right!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:21.150
The kitchen and Tae-san's 
room are off limits. Got it.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:29.460
Excuse me. It's almost time.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.510
I don't need you to tell me that.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.750
Do you have a cold?

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.420
Maybe I got one while out on the terrace.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.890
I brought you these.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.750
You're done for the day, right? Go home.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:05.950
Auntie, you should sell this big place

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:09.640
and use the money to move into a nursing home.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.250
I can put some condos here or something.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.930
Shut up.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.190
I can take care of myself.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.800
Don't be like that.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.040
Your favorite nephew's asking you.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.040
I'm worried about you.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.920
Think about it.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:32.790
Shut up. I said no.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.250
Get out of here.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.180
Fine.

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:51.660
Whatever, I'll be back.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.980
Don't come back!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:27.910
<b>Tae Haruhi</b>

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.630
Pretty, isn't it?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.610
It was a long time ago.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:48.150
That outfit's a little moth-eaten, 
but I can fix it again.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:52.500
I've been in a picture with a pig.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:56.390
So I know pigs are smarter than you think.

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:01.990
I'm fine.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.450
You're really friendly.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.070
Are you somebody's pet?

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.040
I see.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.790
You're hungry.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.940
Here. This is all I've got, 
but you're welcome to it.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.810
I'm embarrassed to admit it, 
but I can't cook at all.

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:41.310
And it's not just cooking.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:44.910
I've never done any of the chores.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.750
I can't really do anything myself.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.250
But I have to pretend I can.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.970
I don't want to end up 
in an old folks home.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.330
I love animals.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:05.360
They can't talk, so I don't 
have to pretend for them.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.610
Words are just sound.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:11.060
They're like lines in a movie: all lies.

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:16.360
Sorry to hurt you.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.060
Go home when you're done.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.360
I'm sure your owner is worried.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.590
Hey! Where are you going?

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.750
That's the kitchen.

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:35.740
I'm a maid.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.750
My client's health is my first priority.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:38.880
Let's go!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.740
Excuse me.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:41.750
Hey!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.990
This is a job worth doing.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.580
It's just a little messy today.

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.000
Hey, come out!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.060
It's fine.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.820
You just lie down.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:01.450
You can't take things into your own hands!

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.240
Here you are.

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:08.240
Special rice with Chinese 
medicinal herbs!

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.560
"Eat it if you get hungry.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.530
I'll be back tomorrow. 
Your maid, Liu Bei"

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:47.770
She wrote it pretty today.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.270
You're here?

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.300
I know.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.990
You must be hungry.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.580
Here, eat up.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.320
It's much better than yesterday's.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:05.630
But if I told her I fed it 
to a pig, she'd get mad.

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:09.360
How about this?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:14.940
You won't eat it? What a shame.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:17.560
Maybe I'll buy something, then.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.190
Oh my, you are eating it.

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.490
They're gone.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.340
What are you doing?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.570
You need to stay in bed.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.040
Oh, come on.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.540
I'm better now.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.560
You need to rest.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.620
Did you eat dinner last night?

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.520
I fed it to a pig.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.400
A pig?

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:06.900
That's a lie.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.410
It's true! There was a pig here.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:11.860
It eats vegetables.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.910
Go buy some things.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.270
Give the pig something else.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:19.310
Like what?

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.660
Well...

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:27.670
So you eat baumkuchen, huh?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.050
Hey.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:39.130
Yes?

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.730
I'm going shopping.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:41.390
Come with me.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.810
Okay!

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.820
I feel like everyone's staring at us.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.400
It's just your imagination.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:20.700
See you tomorrow.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:22.810
Wait.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.440
Would you like to stay for dinner?

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:28.500
It's going to rain.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.730
It's almost time for that pig to come.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.200
You've never met him, have you?

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:37.950
Sorry.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.490
What's wrong?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.410
S-Sorry!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.500
Hey!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.580
Where am I?

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.530
I followed the trail left 
by the secret treasure,

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:29.580
and it lead me to a pig?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.710
Who are you?

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:35.710
The Sweet Little Devil, Oda Nobunaga.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.220
Your secret treasure is mine.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.470
Wait!

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.000
Huh? You're a person?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:15.880
Yes.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.690
I see.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.480
My curse was cast on 
the secret treasure!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.620
Since you took my secret treasure,

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:45.080
I think my curse is affecting you now.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.260
I am the Sweet Little Devil!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.670
I won't lose to a curse.

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:16.020
Wow.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.270
She broke the curse herself!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.300
Good evening, Auntie.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.860
I told you, you can't have the house.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:42.630
Leave.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.730
Oh my, Auntie.

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:47.140
You told me last time you'd 
sign a contract to sell it.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.430
I didn't say that.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:52.670
I brought some people who 
know all about that today.

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:54.520
So you'll be signing it.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:00.480
What are you doing?!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:04.700
That's a contract that 
says you won't complain.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.910
And the deed for this land...

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.280
is in your room, isn't it?

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.270
That's dangerous!

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.460
Who are you?!

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:21.800
I am...

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.810
the maid that protects this house!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:27.890
Excuse me.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:40.900
Hey! Wait! Hey!

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:50.160
You couldn't have thought 
of a better line than that?

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:53.560
Then, I'm...

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.250
I'm the maid that protects this house,

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.880
and Tae-san's friend!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.680
I guess that works.

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.970
Yes! Thank you!

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:47.860
Next time, it's the Four-leaf Clover,

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.990
Ootani Yoshitsugu-san-oink!

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:54.410
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Four Leaves."

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.750
I'll ask you three times 
until you watch it! Oink!
